# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
/target/

# Cargo.lock is committed: this workspace builds executables (node, benchmark_client).
# https://doc.rust-lang.org/cargo/guide/cargo-toml-vs-cargo-lock.html
workspace.xml

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk
scripts/build_and_fab

# `node local-benchmark` (PHASE2-SPEC.md #8) per-node stores/reference config.
.local-bench/
.local-bench*/

# local-dryrun/ (METRICS-DASHBOARD-SPEC.md #5) default data dir: per-node
# stores/prometheus.yaml from `local-dryrun/dryrun.py` runs.
/local-dryrun/data/

# `fab monitor` (METRICS-DASHBOARD-SPEC.md #4) generated Prometheus target list --
# regenerated per committee, not committed.
/monitoring/prometheus-remote.yaml

# Hygiene pass (build-once/deploy-prebuilt-binary): benchmark run artifacts,
# uploaded scratch, and internal working notes never belong in a repo about
# to go public. `*.md`/`!README.md`/`!**/README.md` keeps only README.md
# files tracked -- CLAUDE.md, METRICS-*.md, PHASE*-NOTES.md/SPEC.md, and any
# FINAL_*/SESSION*/AUDIT*/STATUS*/VERIFICATION* report end up untracked.
benchmark/logs/
results/
logs/collector/
.tmp.driveupload/
*.md
!README.md
!**/README.md
